# Kazuha Chevreuse Bennett Xianyun. ~18s Rot. Mono Pyro Plunge with grouping featuring C6 Chev. Skill plunges bookend Kazuha's field time. Kazuha's burst is DPS neutral. 100% collisions for E plunges, 70% for starwicker plunges.

# Option - Options listed by DPS
kazuha char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
kazuha add weapon="harbinger" refine=5 lvl=90/90; # Uptime concerns vs aggressive opponents
#kazuha add weapon="wolffang" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
